	  <br>


          Hail and well met, fellow hunters!<br>
          <br>
          The weekend of September 1st and 2nd, the Hunters of the Mist are having a special celebration.  This is to commemorate the wedding of Huntress Kalynda to our guild leader Lord Hunt Master Xerisk.<br>
          <br>
          Prior to the wedding, there will be some low level events staged in the Field of Bone and Cabilis.  These activities are intended to introduce our guild to some of the younger Iksar, while providing a bit of fun.<br>
          <br>
          Field of Bone Event -- Sweep the pit, Saturday<br>
                                 Sept 1st, 11AM Pacific,<br>
                                 for levels 1 through 8<br>
          <br>
          For this event we will gather up as many young Iksar as possible, temporarily invite them into the guild, form them into groups and then aid<br>
          them in a sweep of the pit from the Cabilis to the Kurn's end.  To aid the hunting parties some appropriate weapons will be supplied, various ability enhancement spells cast and during the sweep, healing provided.<br>
          <br>
          After the event temporary members will be removed from the guild and offered the opportunity to join as full members by completing the proscribed<br>
          requirements.<br>
          <br>
          Cabilis Event -- Fishing Derby, <br>
                           Saturday Sept 1st, 2PM Pacific,<br>
                           for levels 1 through 8<br>
          <br>
          For those Iksar that cannot join the hunt, a second event is planned.  This will take the form of a fishing derby.  The event will take place around the dock area between the stone bridge and the Haggle Baron's.  Bring your poles and bait and be ready to fish.  The derby will be a timed event with prizes given for the most fish caught and the greatest weight of fish caught. During the derby itself you will not be allowed to leave the designated area.  Extra fishing poles and bait will be provided by the contest derby directors.  Prizes will not be spectacular in nature, but will be appropriate for the Iksar just starting out.<br>
          <br>
          If these two events go well, they will be repeated later in the day.<br>
          <br>
          The Wedding -- Sunday September 2nd, <br>
                         12 Noon Pacific,<br>
                         for all of Norrath<br>
          <br>
          You are invited to the wedding of Kalynda and Xerisk Mistslayer, to be conducted on the beach in the Field of Bone, near the Sythrax temple.<br>
          <br>
          For those that don't know the way, or need extra protection in traveling, feel free to contact me prior to the wedding.<br>
          <br>
          After the wedding, and to seal their vows, all in attendance are invited to join with and aid the couple in the hunt, as they go kill something big.<br>
          <br>
          Drinks for all events to be provided by the Slytherson Brewing Company of Cabilis.<br>
          <br>
          Hope to see you this weekend,<br>
          Hunt Master Darezol Vaporscale<br>
          Darezol@Luclin.com<br>
